{"overview":"ساکورا کینوموتو، دانش‌آموز ابتدایی، متوجه می‌شود که قدرت‌های جادویی دارد پس از آزاد کردن تصادفی مجموعه‌ای از کارت‌های جادویی از کتابی که سال‌ها در آن مهر شده بود. او سپس مأمور می‌شود تا آن کارت‌ها را بازیابی کند تا از وقوع یک فاجعه ناشناخته برای جهان جلوگیری کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Sakura Kinomoto, an elementary school student who discovers that she possesses magical powers after accidentally freeing a set of magical cards from the book they had been sealed in for years. She is then tasked with retrieving those cards in order to avoid an unknown catastrophe from befalling the world.","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":5,"y":1998,"poster":"/pFCHDyt9VkgHW79UdxH5ZI6jF5X.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":35,"y":1998,"poster":"/8Sm4JyuY7cBXHbzmKBrmC6Bcf5B.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":11,"y":1999,"poster":"/6IEC4m5fD1Wvjo8DfnIEW6MPc5O.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":24,"y":1999,"poster":"/cKPyXe9dHH4U0seEsdjv8J0Ox6f.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":22,"y":2018,"poster":"/i6D5hJyStFvpPmWa4WxMuLaKtyr.jpg"}],"episodes":92,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"丹下桜","role":"Sakura Kinomoto (voice)","photo":"/3vw8xqbgwRV0x919yd6HiR5YcIJ.jpg","en":"Sakura Tange"},{"name":"岩男潤子","role":"Tomoyo Daidouji (voice)","photo":"/bKyMLT1MgDTnXafsq2ur32VMwY5.jpg","en":"Junko Iwao"},{"name":"くまいもとこ","role":"Syaoran Li (voice)","photo":"/tFbdGP9nflvfJYNNIKHUejnpifm.jpg","en":"Motoko Kumai"},{"name":"久川綾","role":"Kerberos (voice)","photo":"/5asVy8H7VSDQKVdURubT0QHjsld.jpg","en":"Aya Hisakawa"},{"name":"امی شینوهارا","role":"Naoko Yanagisawa (voice)","photo":"/ryGauSE9aoEh5DFMrlFw3H8sATC.jpg","en":"Emi Shinohara"},{"name":"田中秀幸","role":"Fujitaka Kinomoto (voice)","photo":"/1D1PmELZexM6aod77gbh9GwvvGG.jpg","en":"Hideyuki Tanaka"},{"name":"小野坂昌也","role":"Kerberos(big) (voice)","photo":"/zaqlNEMaVBdwXHfdI4VSUgc3h0K.jpg","en":"Masaya Onosaka"},{"name":"緒方恵美","role":"Yukito Tsukishiro (voice)","photo"